# A throw into the pile of light bodies on a path that loses one packet in ten: every body
# that falls asleep must reach the guest at its rest pose.
scenario pile_settle_loss10
scene pile60
seed 13
guests 1
settle 10s

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 10ms loss 10%

p1 grab ball as grab
p1 wait 500ms
p1 throw pile30 speed 8 as throw

expect result grab granted
expect result throw done
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 3deg
expect no_stuck
